    {
      "math_academy_id": "q-324401",
      "knowledge_point_id": "387e57ad-6f80-5b90-8adf-7bf05618b532",
      "knowledge_point": "Solving a Trigonometric Equation Involving Secant with Non-Special Angles",
      "problem": "Find, **in ascending order and rounded to one decimal place**, the two solutions to the equation $5\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\sqrt{2}=3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-2\\sqrt{2}$ for $0\\le x<2\\pi .$\n\n**In ascending order,** the solutions are $x=$\n{{field-1}}\nand $x=$ \n{{field-2}}.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we rearrange the equation and isolate $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\sqrt{2} & =3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 5\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sec}⁡x & =-2\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 2\\operatorname{sec}⁡x & =-3\\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\operatorname{sec}⁡x & =-\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that $\\operatorname{sec}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}.$ Therefore the given equation is equivalent to\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=-\\frac{2}{3\\sqrt{2}}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}.\n$$\n\nThen, we find the principal value of $x,$ rounded to three decimal places:\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=arccos\\,(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3})≈2.062\n$$\n\nOur first solution lies in the $2$nd quadrant and has a reference angle of ${\\theta }_{R}≈\\pi -2.062≈1.080.$ Since $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x<0,$ the second solution must lie in the $3$rd quadrant, and it also has a reference angle ${\\theta }_{R}≈1.080.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977622/assets/c8020c19d17f3e79b825cb4e0cad4471e68ec0e2618a12578115a0fc8c014599.png)\n\nSince the second solution ${x}_{2}$ lies in the $3$rd quadrant, we can find it using the reference angle as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =\\pi +{\\theta }_{R} \\\\  & ≈\\pi +1.080 \\\\  & ≈4.222\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order and rounded to one decimal place, the solutions are $x=2.1$ and $x=4.2.$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "choices": [
